WEBVTT

01:37.530 --> 01:41.160
I wanna shoot my gun!

01:41.160 --> 01:43.830
I wanna shoot it!

01:45.120 --> 01:46.830
AIYEAGGH!

01:48.540 --> 01:50.040
AIYEAGGHH!

01:52.340 --> 01:53.920
I shot my gun!

01:58.340 --> 02:01.600
I missed! I MISSED!

02:01.600 --> 02:04.430
You missed. Too bad.

02:04.430 --> 02:07.560
One more time, then! One more time!

02:07.890 --> 02:10.770
Sorry, but that's not happening.

02:12.020 --> 02:15.150
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

02:19.910 --> 02:22.530
NAMU AMIDA BUTSU.

02:22.530 --> 02:23.790
AIYEAGGH!

02:24.040 --> 02:25.040
I saw nothing!

02:25.040 --> 02:25.950
Don't hurt me!

02:26.290 --> 02:28.040
I didn't see anything!

02:28.040 --> 02:29.210
Yeah?

02:30.120 --> 02:32.210
No energy.

02:32.750 --> 02:34.550
That's the problem with these things...

02:40.130 --> 02:44.600
Good work, Silver KARASU-SAN.

02:45.010 --> 02:47.390
Get going, WARAI JĪ-SAN.

02:45.010 --> 02:47.390
NOTE: WARAI JĪ-SAN is a HAPPY MAN.

02:47.390 --> 02:50.350
Yes, with pleasure!

02:57.490 --> 03:01.070
YOISHO! YOISHO!

03:01.360 --> 03:07.120
Yummy OMOCHI at a RESORT, yeah?

03:07.120 --> 03:10.670
I want to relax you!

03:10.670 --> 03:12.630
A resort?

03:14.880 --> 03:17.960
Girl, they tell me I'm going to die.

03:17.960 --> 03:19.840
I don't have a lot of time left.

03:19.840 --> 03:21.010
What?

03:28.310 --> 03:32.020
In the darkness of Neo-Saitama lurks a terrible business.

03:32.270 --> 03:36.360
It's called Cyber-TSUJIGIRI,
and sometimes, Techno-TSUJIGIRI.

03:32.270 --> 03:36.360
NOTE: Techno-TSUJIGIRI is
TSUJIGIRI with technology.

03:37.360 --> 03:39.320
This business tests weapons, guns,

03:39.320 --> 03:42.740
and sometimes even poisons and bio-weapons

03:42.740 --> 03:45.200
on random passersby in the slums.

03:46.200 --> 03:51.370
Those who commit this crime, if caught in the act, may be shot on sight.

03:52.830 --> 03:55.170
FUCK YO MOMMA!

03:55.670 --> 03:59.300
That is how Silver KARASU makes his living.

04:01.340 --> 04:03.340
What a terrifying project!

04:03.720 --> 04:05.260
We won't make it in time!

04:05.260 --> 04:07.180
Nobody is left who can fight!

04:09.770 --> 04:12.100
This is the end!

04:12.100 --> 04:14.150
BARIKI BOI! BARIKI BOI!

04:14.150 --> 04:16.810
He flies through the sky!
BARIKI BOI! BARIKI BOI!

04:16.810 --> 04:19.940
He's really strong! BARIKI BOI! BARIKI BOI!

04:18.780 --> 04:19.940
DŌMO.

04:19.940 --> 04:21.320
He can walk through fire!

04:21.030 --> 04:22.820
I am Kagi Tanaka.

04:21.320 --> 04:22.820
You're safe now, friends!

04:23.200 --> 04:25.780
BARIKI BOY is here to save the day!

04:23.530 --> 04:26.280
DŌMO. I am Yamoto Koki.

04:25.780 --> 04:27.030
You!

04:26.990 --> 04:28.990
May I?

04:27.030 --> 04:29.490
BARIKI BOY of Yoroshisan Pharmaceuticals!

04:29.490 --> 04:30.950
I'll make you pay!

04:30.950 --> 04:32.580
You came to save me!

04:31.540 --> 04:32.580
Go ahead.

04:32.580 --> 04:34.790
BARIKI BOY of Yoroshisan Pharmaceuticals!

04:34.790 --> 04:36.670
It's the power of my BARIKI drink!

04:36.670 --> 04:38.040
Now taste my KARATE!

04:42.170 --> 04:44.300
Curse you, BARIKI BOY!

04:44.300 --> 04:46.640
I'll get you next time!

04:46.640 --> 04:52.310
Using the power of my galactic empire!

04:52.310 --> 04:56.350
Your drying is finished.

05:03.780 --> 05:06.780
Well, um... DŌMO.

05:07.320 --> 05:10.490
It's not really dangerous
around here, but take care.

05:10.950 --> 05:11.870
Okay.

05:31.100 --> 05:33.850
DŌMO. I am NUTSCRACKER.

05:33.850 --> 05:34.810
DŌMO.

05:35.270 --> 05:36.980
I am Yamoto Koki.

05:39.270 --> 05:41.940
Don't underestimate the SŌKAIYA SYNDICATE.

05:41.940 --> 05:45.900
It's a MIRACLE that you made it this far at all.

05:41.940 --> 05:45.900
NOTE: MIRACLE means KISEKI.

05:46.450 --> 05:47.200
YEEART!

05:47.200 --> 05:47.910
YEEART!!

05:47.910 --> 05:48.870
EYYAAAGH!

05:52.490 --> 05:56.790
Your pathetic KARATE told me all I need to know about your skill.

05:56.790 --> 06:00.920
A kid like this beat Sonic Boom-SAN and Bicorn-SAN?

06:01.250 --> 06:02.340
That's a lie.

06:02.670 --> 06:04.210
Who's helping you?

06:04.210 --> 06:05.590
YEEART!

06:12.350 --> 06:16.230
The SŌKAIYA SYNDICATE has the data on your JUTSU.

06:17.100 --> 06:19.690
A child's ORIGAMI missiles?

06:20.690 --> 06:23.520
You can't use them in this cramped room!

06:23.520 --> 06:24.820
NAMU SAN!

06:24.820 --> 06:27.320
What a sly method NUTSCRACKER has chosen!

06:27.320 --> 06:29.110
Worthy of the FŪRIN KAZAN!

06:29.610 --> 06:31.490
First, beg for your life.

06:31.490 --> 06:33.330
Then give me your helper's name.

06:33.740 --> 06:36.620
Or we can do this the fun way, if you like.

06:36.620 --> 06:42.250
I usually don't care for flat-chested girls like you, but I can still get my rocks off!

06:42.250 --> 06:43.500
In other words—

06:48.010 --> 06:52.430
In other words, you weren't expecting an ambush.

06:52.680 --> 06:54.470
ᗅ... ᗅᗺᗷᗅ...

06:54.470 --> 06:55.470
You bastard—

06:56.140 --> 06:58.980
A SŌKAIYA NINJA?

06:58.980 --> 07:01.230
I really don't want any trouble.

07:01.230 --> 07:02.900
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

07:06.070 --> 07:09.030
SA... SAYŌNARA!

07:09.030 --> 07:10.740
Yeah. SAYŌNARA.

07:14.600 --> 07:17.580
A-Are you a NINJA?

07:18.290 --> 07:22.120
What the hell did you do?

07:23.000 --> 07:29.090
You see all these round black spots?

07:29.090 --> 07:32.760
When it's progressed this far,
it's pretty much all over.

07:32.760 --> 07:33.760
No good, huh?

07:33.760 --> 07:39.600
We've learned that there are some things that not even a NINJA can handle, yes.

07:39.600 --> 07:41.230
Will I last six months?

07:41.230 --> 07:43.900
No, unfortunately.

07:44.610 --> 07:46.320
You have some money, right?

07:46.320 --> 07:49.940
If you're a NINJA, why not spend your last days enjoying yourself?

07:49.940 --> 07:53.160
Or perhaps taking care of unfinished business?

07:53.160 --> 07:56.160
I'm thinking of quitting my job.

07:56.160 --> 07:57.330
Yeah?

07:57.330 --> 08:01.160
I've got money. I want to move somewhere warmer.

08:01.160 --> 08:04.790
Sounds like a RESORT. I'd want in on that.

08:04.790 --> 08:06.630
Anyway, you're so weird.

08:06.630 --> 08:09.090
Taking in a little girl...

08:09.090 --> 08:11.340
You? Some girl's protector?

08:11.340 --> 08:13.880
You've been acting so weird, lately.

08:13.880 --> 08:15.510
Of course I am.

08:15.510 --> 08:16.760
I'm going to die soon.

08:16.760 --> 08:18.180
That again?

08:18.180 --> 08:19.270
You're so weird.

08:20.100 --> 08:23.230
Well, if we ever get to meet again, let's...

08:23.230 --> 08:24.810
We will, right?

08:24.810 --> 08:25.560
Yeah.

08:26.900 --> 08:28.400
If I don't die first.

08:37.450 --> 08:40.160
What am I doing?

08:41.330 --> 08:44.000
Nah, don't worry about it.

08:44.000 --> 08:48.710
Anyway, is it true that you defeated Sonic Boom?

08:50.090 --> 08:51.420
Yeah, I bet.

08:51.920 --> 08:54.090
I've crossed paths with him before.

08:54.090 --> 08:56.430
JUTSU wouldn't be enough to beat him.

08:56.760 --> 09:01.100
You have no KARATE, so even NINJAS like NUTSCRACKER will laugh at you.

09:01.720 --> 09:06.270
If I hadn't acted on a whim,
you would've died there.

09:07.060 --> 09:08.940
I'm not saying you owe me.

09:08.940 --> 09:10.570
And I'm not blaming you.

09:11.190 --> 09:13.280
Hey, no crying.

09:14.900 --> 09:18.200
My KARATE is IAIDŌ. I use a sword.

09:18.200 --> 09:22.120
But all DŌ start with the same KARATE movements.

09:22.860 --> 09:24.960
First: KAWARA-WARI.

09:25.460 --> 09:28.630
Up to down.

09:32.250 --> 09:33.090
Yeah.

09:34.340 --> 09:36.130
I think that'll do.

09:36.130 --> 09:38.800
Up to down.

09:42.100 --> 09:43.470
Yeah.

09:47.270 --> 09:48.230
Up...

09:49.310 --> 09:49.360
...to down.

10:05.120 --> 10:06.540
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

10:07.410 --> 10:09.670
NAMU AMIDA BUTSU.

10:10.210 --> 10:11.840
Okay, looks good.

10:11.840 --> 10:16.470
Get closer to the body and get some photos, please.

10:16.470 --> 10:17.970
What?

10:18.220 --> 10:20.050
AIYEEAGH! Konachi-SAN!

10:18.220 --> 10:20.050
The cops are on their way.

10:20.050 --> 10:21.260
Konachi-SAN!

10:20.050 --> 10:21.640
Do it anyway.

10:21.260 --> 10:22.930
AIYEEAGH!

10:21.640 --> 10:22.930
Another group—

10:25.470 --> 10:26.600
Roger.

10:26.980 --> 10:29.230
But you'd better be ready to pay a bonus.

10:41.780 --> 10:42.950
Kagi-SAN!

10:43.200 --> 10:45.660
Oh, you're awake?

10:45.660 --> 10:47.960
It's gotta be past your bedtime.

10:48.250 --> 10:49.290
Those wounds—

10:49.290 --> 10:50.960
Work.

10:50.960 --> 10:53.540
Hey, you got any cigarettes?

10:53.540 --> 10:55.090
Nah, you wouldn't.

10:55.090 --> 10:58.010
Anyway, we need to talk about what you do now—

11:02.890 --> 11:04.720
Oh, this blood?

11:04.720 --> 11:06.720
It's got nothing to do with my wounds.

11:07.140 --> 11:09.270
So I'm fine.

11:09.270 --> 11:11.270
You're not fine at all!

11:11.270 --> 11:14.730
In other words, it's not an injury from a fight.

11:14.730 --> 11:17.860
What I picked up in that fight is way less serious than this.

11:17.860 --> 11:18.740
So it all works out.

11:18.740 --> 11:19.650
You need to go to a hospital!

11:19.650 --> 11:21.780
I already did, so shut up!

11:25.910 --> 11:27.120
Sorry.

11:27.120 --> 11:30.330
Hey, don't cry. I said I'm sorry.

11:30.330 --> 11:34.130
That's not it, Kagi-SAN...

11:36.920 --> 11:38.340
I'm going to take a bath.

11:39.130 --> 11:40.220
You sleep.

11:45.430 --> 11:48.350
I see. So this is how it ends.

11:49.180 --> 11:52.440
Unfinished business, huh?

11:53.560 --> 11:55.060
BUDDHA-DONO...

11:59.610 --> 12:01.820
Fuck it all.

12:03.910 --> 12:05.030
Hey.
